    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Lane topology \u2014 every hop of every chain",
      "description": "Hop # 0 is the lane's primary; the rest are its ordered fallbacks. Deployment id `unknown` means litellm.yaml set no model_info.id on that deployment \u2014 litellm then generates a hash, so no live event can ever be joined back to it. Two rows sharing a Lane and a Hop # are a POOL: litellm load-balances across them rather than trying them in order.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "ferry-vm"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 16,
        "h": 11
